# Probe scratch space, and any lock a local run writes into this Skill's own
# directory. Neither is an artifact: `.fgc/probe-cache/` is #17's cache and
# `fgc.lock.json` belongs to the *project* being decided, not to the Skill.
.fgc/
fgc.lock.json

# Local decision files an Agent writes while working. The recording contract is
# `references/decision-recording.md`; a working file is not a delivered artifact.
*.decision.json

node_modules/
*.log
